      "points": 8,
      "stem": "Perform polynomial long division to obtain polynomials $q(x)$ and $r(x)$ that satisfy\n\n$$\n\\frac{x^3}{x^2 + x - 3} = q(x) + \\frac{r(x)}{x^2 + x - 3}\n$$\n\nand that the degree of $r(x)$ is strictly less than 2. What is $r(x)$?",
      "choices": [
